# Learn more https://docs.github.com/en/get-started/getting-started-with-git/ignoring-files

# dependencies
node_modules/

# Expo
.expo/
dist/
web-build/
expo-env.d.ts

# Native
.kotlin/
*.orig.*
*.jks
*.p8
*.p12
*.key
*.mobileprovision

# Metro
.metro-health-check*

# debug
npm-debug.*
yarn-debug.*
yarn-error.*

# macOS
.DS_Store
*.pem

# local env files
.env
.env*.local
server/.env
.env.development
.env.production
server/.env.development
server/.env.production

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo

# generated native folders
/ios
/android
.vercel

# Arthur: NarIyirm
# 中文：演示文稿、文档渲染和本地工具环境仅保存在仓库外，避免把生成产物提交到 GitHub。
# EN: Keep presentation, document-rendering, and local tool workspaces outside the repository.
/.codex-document-build/
/.codex-presentation-build/
/.ppt-master-env/
/output/
/projects/
/assets/presentation/
/Build/
/models/
/branding/

# Arthur: NarIyirm
# 中文：厨房主页依赖此 GLB；仅跟踪这一项，确保新电脑和 CI 能正常打包，同时继续忽略其他本地模型。
# EN: The kitchen home requires this GLB; track only this asset so fresh machines and CI can bundle while other local models stay ignored.
!/models/
/models/*
!/models/Kitchen-Home-rebuilt-lighting.glb

# Arthur: NarIyirm
# 中文：docs 中保留可审阅的文本资料，忽略不适合版本控制的二进制办公文档。
# EN: Keep reviewable text documentation in docs while excluding binary office artifacts.
/docs/**/*.ppt
/docs/**/*.pptx
/docs/**/*.doc
/docs/**/*.docx
/docs/**/*.pdf
